  abstract        = {Random Forest bias correction of daily and hourly WRF-CAMx PM2.5 and PM10 forecasts for Delhi, trained on October 2021 to September 2023 and tested on October 2023 to April 2024. For PM2.5, MAPE fell from 43% to 27%, RMSE from 73 to 42 µg/m³, and correlation rose from 0.70 to 0.78. The model tracks average trends well but underestimates peak values.},
